{"unit_id":"hackmagic__dsh-unreal-agentlink#card-zh","repo":"hackmagic/dsh-unreal-agentlink","commit":"e39fddea694aea82a7097023409c567c1e10256a","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-unreal-agentlink 是把 Unreal Editor 接入 DSH agent 的开发工具插件。它在本机启动 WebSocket 桥接服务，并向 DSH 注册命令发现、查询、执行和批量调用等工具。agent 可操作编辑器中的关卡、蓝图与材质，读取日志、查看截图、管理编辑器选择和长时任务。它适合希望让 DSH agent 辅助 Unreal Engine 项目制作与排查问题的开发者。需要在项目中安装 UnrealAgentLink 编辑器插件；桥接默认监听本机 127.0.0.1:17860。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:77-89","src/tools/generic.ts:38-42","src/tools/operations.ts:64-80","src/config.ts:92-100"]}
